sondern sich von freiwilligen Bürgern aus dem Ort helfen lässt, um als Sheriff-Nachfolger Teil der Dorfgemeinschaft zu werden.","poster":"/40huh4qGKZrnuXzyqVpi0UsPo8O.jpg","runtime":85.0,"title":"Die gnadenlosen Vier","type":"movie","va":6.2,"vc":31,"year":"1961"},"tv:119026":{"cast":[{"id":74688,"name":"Keke Palmer","photo":"/x3eFVQVw4vOCJByLlkBnMMwEnG7.jpg"},{"id":2981682,"name":"Benny Rivera","photo":""},{"id":2981684,"name":"Amirah Kassem","photo":""},{"id":1371039,"name":"Anthony Mendez","photo":"/p6aJA6De9KWR8vlw1nK0VnVJtFy.jpg"}],"genres":["Reality"],"id":119026,"original":"Foodtastic","overview":"Keke Palmer moderiert diesen bunten Wettbewerb, in dem sogenannte Food-Artists lebensgroße Skulpturen, die komplett aus Lebensmitteln bestehen, kreieren. Und da diese Show bei Disney+ zu sehen ist, beziehen sich alle Kreationen selbstverständlich auf berühmte Disney-Figuren, -Filme und -Serien wie „Toy Story“ oder „Star Wars“.","poster":"/AuqOsO9XbCzMeIjz0GCoUi1aiA6.jpg","runtime":45.0,"title":"Foodtastic","type":"series","va":4.6,"vc":5,"year":"2021"},"tv:126954":{"cast":[{"id":1227918,"name":"Roberto Durán","photo":"/940L6zeSWuxNVLkwgGLW96NZHDn.jpg"},{"id":216149,"name":"Marvin Hagler","photo":"/tnDuXxs6bucrEnVRruFpmjyPDt7.jpg"},{"id":1214149,"name":"Thomas Hearns","photo":"/eu7F4eikbn0EHBXJZj4eM1BtnMx.jpg"},{"id":155766,"name":"Sugar Ray Leonard","photo":"/mgtPdj3Ov2cd3dMrhuYHcHcuEmA.jpg"}],"genres":["Dokumentarfilm"],"id":126954,"original":"The Kings","overview":"","poster":"/jDiqDkx4Ej9dYSK1djOAlMW3wq5.jpg","runtime":58.0,"title":"The Kings","type":"series","va":6.9,"vc":34,"year":"2021"},"tv:128699":{"cast":[{"id":1820070,"name":"龚俊","photo":"/4KInYhdUoeV7Pd6eMQGcrhQVOWC.jpg"},{"id":1376103,"name":"張慧雯","photo":"/medfjgb0DvHMWsyEyOortnCps3R.jpg"},{"id":1944965,"name":"龐瀚辰","photo":"/Asu0dEjpm4oJq5vgdfauPDmE9SN.jpg"},{"id":3148001,"name":"周麟嘉","photo":"/7WtSGIDnSkJEIDxXopAh68FWRJm.jpg"},{"id":3095557,"name":"Luo Yi","photo":"/m8penGKLdI40is2plY2mgF5RN7G.jpg"},{